                {
                  "formattedValue": "Theorem 3.1 (pp. 4–5) omits a rational-input-rate hypothesis: positive irrational changes to three rates preserve the exact rational field but force an irrational free parameter. Integer constructions remain supported. No page or repair; deferred for later correction. https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/53b0a68df4d43528ae145aae514a0d2861e4cd89/research_website_catalogue_20261024/papers/21753997/disposition.json",
